IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `au-part6-more`

-- Tests for s 29(2). Expected values are written from the text: "This section does not affect the operation of section 160 of the
-- Evidence Act 1995."

§ `Section 29(2)`

-- Where section 160 of the Evidence Act 1995 would operate, section 29 does not stop it: the answer is no.
#ASSERT `section 29 stops section 160 of the Evidence Act 1995 operating` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Where it would not operate, the subsection has nothing to say.
#ASSERT `section 29 stops section 160 of the Evidence Act 1995 operating` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
